## Key Concepts
- IAM bindings and drift detection
- Cloud Asset Inventory/Resource Manager
- Cloud Storage baselines, BigQuery insertId strategy
- Pub/Sub orchestration and Cloud Scheduler
- Retries/backoff and idempotent remediation

